                                                "sense_id": "72007bc8-7ead-309e-af1b-0099bacca66a",
                                                "text": "In London, of all places, where people are always on the lookout for opportunities to commit crimes: an unzipped handbag, a phone sticking out of a back pocket, an unpadlocked bike."
